# Mansion fight for timing / PGO (from MANSION_HITCH.md's fight script): the mission script, then RT and walking in the level.
# Boot -> mission 4 MANSION | INFILTRATION: 4 DOWN presses on MISSION SELECT, for run_all_missions.ps1.
# Generated by tools/gen_mission_scripts.py (routing from the 13:00 probe, log 108: linear list 0-13, nothing
# locked, a DOWN every 2.5 s from 24 s; the choose A 2.5 s after the last DOWN; then A every 2 s to 200 s).
press 8.0 A         # Microsoft logo / Rare intro just starting: normally ignored
press 10.0 A        # Rare intro video: skips it
press 12.0 A        # frontend loading: normally lost
press 14.0 A        # PRESS START title -> main menu
press 16.0 A        # main menu, Campaign -> MISSION MODE
press 18.0 A        # MISSION MODE, Solo Agent -> MISSION SELECT (MISSION 0 DATACORE, up by about 21 s)
press 24.0 DOWN     # MISSION SELECT -> 1 NIGHTCLUB | STAKEOUT
press 26.5 DOWN     # MISSION SELECT -> 2 SUBWAY | RETRIEVAL
press 29.0 DOWN     # MISSION SELECT -> 3 ROOFTOPS | ESCAPE
press 31.5 DOWN     # MISSION SELECT -> 4 MANSION | INFILTRATION
repeat 36.0 100.0 2.0 A 0.15   # setup / briefing / START MISSION / loading / cutscene skips, then in level
# Mansion combat (MANSION_HITCH.md): in level from ~90 s. God mode on the command line. Fire (RT) in bursts to draw
# the guards, walk forward with slow turns so the view and the AI keep changing, and back again.
repeat 100.0 470.0 0.6 RT 0.35
stick 100.0 6.0 0 14000 0 0
stick 106.0 1.5 0 0 9000 0
stick 107.5 6.0 0 14000 0 0
